cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this simulator, please cite this software release."
title: "HOCCA-Simulator: reference environment for communication-constrained cooperative multi-UAV search"
abstract: >-
  A dependency-light reference environment for cooperative multi-UAV search with
  budgeted evidence sharing. It provides a 48 x 48 grid with 16 targets of which
  4 are mobile, 4 unit-speed UAVs with turn commands on a 12-heading lattice, a
  Euclidean disk sensor with a configurable detection and false-alarm
  probability, a log-odds occupancy filter, provenance-tagged evidence with
  once-only fusion, a value-of-information scheduler under a hard item budget,
  potential shaping with differential information credit, evaluation metrics, a
  rule-based controller and a Gymnasium-compatible interface.
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-01-01"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/wkx12138-w/HOCCASim"
keywords:
  - multi-uav
  - cooperative-search
  - multi-agent-reinforcement-learning
  - option-critic
  - value-of-information
  - communication-budget
  - bayesian-occupancy-filter
authors:
